            Read the quick start
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" class="arrow"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/arg1998/BrowserHive">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" class="gh"><path d="M12 .5a11.5 11.5 0 0 0-3.64 22.41c.58.1.79-.25.79-.56v-2c-3.2.7-3.88-1.37-3.88-1.37-.52-1.33-1.28-1.69-1.28-1.69-1.05-.72.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.77 2.7 1.26 3.36.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.55-.29-5.24-1.28-5.24-5.68 0-1.26.45-2.28 1.19-3.08-.12-.29-.52-1.46.11-3.05 0 0 .97-.31 3.17 1.18a11 11 0 0 1 5.77 0c2.2-1.49 3.17-1.18 3.17-1.18.63 1.59.23 2.76.11 3.05.74.8 1.19 1.82 1.19 3.08 0 4.41-2.69 5.39-5.25 5.67.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.14v3.17c0 .31.21.67.8.56A11.5 11.5 0 0 0 12 .5Z"></path></svg>
